    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/islamic-trust/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Islamic Trust Theme is a beautifully designed and purpose-driven template crafted for Islamic organizations, mosques, Islamic centers, Muslim charities, Quran schools, madrasa websites, dawah platforms, Islamic foundations, humanitarian entities, and community centers, particularly those operating as a nonprofit company committed to meaningful social impact where people can contribute generously in the spirit of faith and service. Built to support the Islamic religion, this theme allows organizations to showcase their mission, projects, and initiatives while engaging with the Muslim Ummah globally through transparent and structured avenues for supporters to donate and participate. Whether you're managing a masjid, Islamic school, Islamic library, charity hub, or an online dawah center, this theme provides a professional and visually appealing digital presence that encourages visitors to donate towards important causes. It includes features such as prayer time schedules, Quranic verses, Hadith collections, Islamic lectures, event management, and donation systems, all designed to support non-profit activities and facilitate contributions for Zakat, Sadaqah, Waqf, and crowdfunding campaigns. The theme effectively promotes Islamic charity, humanitarian efforts, and fosters regular giving while supporting Zakat collection, Sadaqah contributions, and Waqf management. With integrated Hijri calendar support, it highlights significant Islamic events like Ramadan, Eid al-Fitr, and Eid al-Adha to inspire community participation and charitable giving. Additionally, the WooCommerce-powered store enables the sale of Islamic books, Halal products, modest clothing, and digital resources, further enhancing nonprofit outreach and encouraging users to give back through purchases that align with Islamic education and lifestyle. Featuring customization options, animations, and translation-ready settings, the elegant, clean, and responsive design ensures a user-friendly experience on all devices, helping organizations inspire trust and motivate visitors to easily support their causes. With essential plugins like Contact Form 7 for donations, inquiries, and event registrations, the Islamic Trust Theme is perfect for dawah initiatives and charitable organizations dedicated to spreading knowledge and serving humanity through effective volunteer matching and support."
    },
